OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FITV News Sports Editor Steve Scott
OL,8,Fassesses the victory against Mexico,
OL,9,Fwhile Correspondent Ben Chapman speaks
OL,10,Fto jubilant fans and Correspondent
OL,11,FRachel Younger looks ahead to
OL,12,FEngland's next opponent
OL,14,FEngland have secured their place in
OL,15,Fthe quarter-finals of the World Cup
OL,16,Fafter beating Mexico 3-2 following a
OL,17,Ftense match that left fans of both
OL,18,Fnations on the edge of their seats.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FThe game opened with some wobbles from
OL,8,FEngland, but then Jude Bellingham
OL,9,Fscored two goals less than 100 seconds
OL,10,Fapart just over half an hour into the
OL,11,Fgame.
OL,13,FMinutes later, just as England fans
OL,14,Fbegan to think a win was assured,
OL,15,FJulian Quinones got one past Jordan
OL,16,FPickford, bringing the score to 2-1 as
OL,17,Fthe first half ended.
OL,19,FThe second half got off to a tough
OL,20,Fstart for England after Jarrel Quansah
OL,21,Fwas handed a red card 10 minutes in.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FBut minutes later, Kane scored a
OL,8,Fpenalty kick after Anthony Gordon was
OL,9,Fwiped out by Mexico goalkeeper Raul
OL,10,FRangel, putting England 3-1 up.
OL,12,FThen, in quick succession, Kane was
OL,13,Fpenalised for tackling Brian Gutierrez
OL,14,Fwhile contesting the ball in the box,
OL,15,Fleading to a penalty for Mexico, which
OL,16,FRaul Jimenez scored, bringing the
OL,17,Ftotal to 3-2.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FEngland fought out the last part of
OL,8,Fthe game on the defensive, with Mexico
OL,9,Fconstantly frustrated despite numerous
OL,10,Fattempts on goal.
OL,12,FThe Three Lions will now take on
OL,13,FNorway in the quarter-finals on
OL,14,FSaturday after Erling Haaland's two
OL,15,Fgoals helped his team pull off a
OL,16,Fstunning upset against Brazil on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,19,FThe Prince of Wales congratulated
OL,20,FEngland after their 3-2 victory over
OL,21,FMexico in the World Cup.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,F"Well done England! Bring on the
OL,8,Fquarter final!" William wrote on X.
OL,10,FPrime Minister Keir Starmer branded
OL,11,Fthe match "one of the greatest England
OL,12,Fmatches I've ever seen" in a post on X
OL,13,Fand said he was "incredibly proud to
OL,14,Fbe English".
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FThe Prime Minister's official
OL,8,Fspokesman said: "The Prime Minister
OL,9,Fwatched the match last night and
OL,10,Fstayed up to do so. He watched it
OL,11,Fupstairs in the Downing Street flat
OL,12,Fwith his son, and he's a touch sleep-
OL,13,Fdeprived this morning, but incredibly
OL,14,Fproud of the team, and incredibly
OL,15,Fproud to be English after that
OL,16,Fperformance."
OL,18,FUS President Donald Trump also took to
OL,19,Fsocial media following the game,
OL,20,Fhailing captain Kane as a "GREAT
OL,21,Fplayer".
OL,26,@pD@QOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FKane, England's record World Cup
OL,8,Fgoalscorer, is one behind Erling
OL,9,FHaaland, Kylian Mbappe and Lionel
OL,10,FMessi in the race for the Golden Boot.
OL,12,FThe game was delayed by an hour due to
OL,13,Fsevere weather over Mexico City that
OL,14,Flasted all afternoon.
OL,16,FAt about 2.30pm (9.30pm BST), heavy
OL,17,Frain and thunderstorms greeted England
OL,18,Fand Mexico fans outside the Estadio
OL,19,FAzteca, with loud rumbles of thunder
OL,20,Fcoming and going in the hours before
OL,21,Fkick-off.
OL,26,@qD@Vrr
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FSupporters packed out hundreds of bars
OL,8,Fand pubs for the late-night clash
OL,9,Fafter the government extended opening
OL,10,Fhours to 5am on Monday, with beers
OL,11,Fflying into the air at the final
OL,12,Fwhistle following 11 minutes of added
OL,13,Ftime.
OL,15,FIn a cheeky message to supporters back
OL,16,Fhome who pulled an all-nighter to
OL,17,Fwatch, two-goal hero Bellingham said:
OL,18,F"Text your bosses and tell them you're
OL,19,Fnot coming in, simple as that."
OL,26,@zD@AOU{D@_O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FHe added: "Kids stay off school,
OL,8,Fparents don't go to work, enjoy your
OL,9,Fday, have the day off if you can,
OL,10,Fthese nights don't come often."
OL,12,FThe England squad repeated their
OL,13,Fpractice of singing Wonderwall with
OL,14,Ffans in the stadium after the win.
OL,16,FIt wasn't all good news after the
OL,17,Fvictory, with unused substitute
OL,18,FHenderson taking a nasty fall climbing
OL,19,Fback over the advertising boards
OL,20,Ffollowing the singalong.
OL,26,@oD@KOUrD@_O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FHe left the field on a stretcher
OL,8,Fbefore being taken to a hospital in
OL,9,FMexico City.
OL,11,FIt was later confirmed he would not
OL,12,Freturn to Kansas City with the rest of
OL,13,Fthe squad on Sunday evening as he
OL,14,Fcontinued to receive medical treatment.
OL,16,FManager Thomas Tuchel told ITV it
OL,17,Flooked "serious" and "not good",
OL,18,Fadding: "I am exhausted, of course,
OL,19,Fand emotional but also sad because
OL,20,FJordan got injured.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,F"He injured his wrist. He is at the
OL,8,Fmoment at the hospital, so it is quite
OL,9,Fa serious injury.
OL,11,F"It just doesn't fit to the evening
OL,12,Fthat Jordan is now not with us. I
OL,13,Fdon't know the procedure what is going
OL,14,Fon. I just did the press, and the doc
OL,15,Ftold me he's in hospital."
OL,17,FBut he also said the victory was a
OL,18,F"big win" for a "special team".
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUwD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FThe occasion also seemed to get to
OL,8,FEngland captain Harry Kane after he
OL,9,Flost his voice following the post-game
OL,10,Fcelebrations and struggled with media
OL,11,Finterviews.
OL,13,FSpeaking to ITV, he said the match
OL,14,Fwent "right to the top" of the
OL,15,Fmemories he had of winning games for
OL,16,FEngland.
OL,18,FHe highlighted the defensive play for
OL,19,Fthe final 40 minutes when playing with
OL,20,F10 men, saying he was "so proud to be
OL,21,Fpart of this team."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G12/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
