OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783675207
OL,3,CEngland through to quarter-finals
OL,4,Cafter beating Mexico 3-2 in thrilling
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FCo-hosts Mexico had lost only two of
OL,8,Ftheir previous 89 competitive games at
OL,9,Fthe Estadio Azteca, which lies more
OL,10,Fthan 2,200 metres above sea level.
